torch-aarch64-macosx: third-party notices

This package carries libtorchrkt, the native half of the Racket package
`torch` (Apache-2.0, https://github.com/bkc39/rktorch), and the shared
libraries it loads. Each is listed below with its version, licence and
upstream source; the licence texts are under licenses/. The libraries are
unmodified upstream builds, or were built from the listed sources by
scripts/platform/macos/build.sh in the rktorch repository at the tag this
package was released from. Their install names were rewritten to @rpath and
each was re-signed ad hoc; their code is otherwise unchanged. Every library
licensed under the LGPL is shipped as a separate shared library that can be
replaced.

libtorchrkt.dylib
  rktorch's own shim. Apache-2.0.
  Compiles in stb_image (stb commit 5736b15f7ea0ffb08dd38af21067c314d6a3aae9),
  MIT or Unlicense, at your option: licenses/stb-LICENSE.
  https://github.com/nothings/stb

libtorch_cpu.dylib, libc10.dylib, libtorch.dylib
  PyTorch libtorch 2.14.0, macOS arm64 build, from the official
  libtorch-macos-arm64-2.14.0.zip. BSD-3-Clause: licenses/pytorch-LICENSE,
  with the third-party notices of PyTorch's own source in
  licenses/pytorch-NOTICE (both from the v2.14.0 tag; the zip carries no
  licence text). It uses Apple's Accelerate framework from the system and
  contains no Intel MKL.
  https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/tree/v2.14.0
  https://download.pytorch.org/libtorch/cpu/libtorch-macos-arm64-2.14.0.zip

libomp.dylib
  The LLVM OpenMP runtime, as shipped in the libtorch zip above.
  Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception: licenses/llvm-openmp-LICENSE.TXT, the
  openmp/LICENSE.TXT of LLVM 19.1.0 (the runtime names Clang 19.1 as its
  build compiler).
  https://github.com/llvm/llvm-project/tree/llvmorg-19.1.0/openmp

libsndfile.1.dylib
  libsndfile 1.2.2. LGPL-2.1-or-later: licenses/libsndfile-COPYING.
  https://github.com/libsndfile/libsndfile/releases/download/1.2.2/libsndfile-1.2.2.tar.xz

